msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"Look at you, Kiryu-chan! That's exactly the image we're\r\n"
"going for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "(Must be some kind of samurai flick...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Here's the script. You only have to worry about Tatsu's⑬the hero's⑬lines. "
"Memorize 'em as best you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"Tatsu bursts into Yamashiro's compound.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Yamashiro: What the hell do you want!?\r\n"
"<Color:255,0,0,255>Tatsu: I've come to avenge my father.<Color:Default>\r\n"
"Yamashiro: You've got some nerve busting in here.\r\n"
"So you want to see your precious father, huh?\r\n"
"Oh, I'll send you to meet him... in hell!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"Tatsu takes out Yamashiro's thugs <Color:7>in this order<Color:Default>:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<Color:7>Hanai (short hair)<Color:Default> charges at Tatsu, and Tatsu "
"smashes him head on.\r\n"
"Once fired up, Tatsu then whales on <Color:7>Toriumi (long "
"hair)<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"Next, he shuts down <Color:7>Matsukaze (bearded)<Color:Default>, who's in a "
"rage,\r\n"
"and finally beats <Color:7>Otsuki (bald)<Color:Default> to finish them off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Yamashiro: Very impressive.\r\n"
"<Color:255,0,0,255>Tatsu: Fight me one-on-one like a real "
"man.<Color:Default>\r\n"
"Yamashiro: Ha! We can discuss that once you've\r\n"
"defeated my finest assassin! Assassin, get out here!\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Assassin enters.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Yamashiro: This is the man who killed your father,\r\n"
"and he's more skilled than you can imagine.\r\n"
"So prepare to die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"Tatsu confronts his father's assassin.\r\n"
"First, he <Color:7>unleashes a series of raging techniques<Color:Default>\r\n"
"to take out the henchmen:\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Grabbing and smashing one into the wall (<Color:7>Essence of "
"Terrain<Color:Default>),\r\n"
"then killing another with a triple sword slash (<Color:7>Essence of "
"Weaponry<Color:Default>),\r\n"
"and finally smashing a daruma doll over the last one's head with a karate "
"chop\r\n"
"(<Color:7>Essence of Weaponry<Color:Default>) to finally avenge his father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"Yamashiro: Bunch of worthless dogs! I suppose\r\n"
"I'll have to deal with you myself!\r\n"
"<Color:255,0,0,255>Tatsu: No need to worry. I'll make quick work of "
"you.<Color:Default>\r\n"
"Yamashiro: Nonsense! You'll regret you ever\r\n"
"crossed me when I'm through with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"The time has come to face Yamashiro, the sinister villain behind it all.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"While Tatsu unleashes an amazing array of attacks, defeating\r\n"
"Yamashiro for good is a much harder bargain.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Tatsu is beat to within an inch of his life <Color:7>(Health Gauge flashes "
"red)<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"but he manages to <Color:7>win with a miraculous comeback<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"Yamashiro: Listen... Work for me...\r\n"
"and I'll make you rich beyond your wildest dreams!\r\n"
"Sound good? Let's forget about this whole thing with\r\n"
"your father, and think about what's best for tomorrow.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<Color:255,0,0,255>Tatsu: My loyalty can't be bought.<Color:Default>\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Tatsu punches Yamashiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Yamashiro: So this is...\r\n"
"The legendary Tatsu of Kamuro...\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Tatsu turns his back on a nearly dead Yamashiro and exits.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"~Fin~"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Got the lines down yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Not quite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Not a problem, not a problem. You read 'em thoroughly and\r\n"
"get 'em down pat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"(So, a lone warrior bursts into the local authority's compound to avenge "
"his dead father... Looks like your typical samurai B-movie.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "You bet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Feel free to ad-lib if you can't remember it word for word,\r\n"
"just as long as it works well. Saying the lines as written\r\n"
"can sound wooden sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"Also, do your best with the action sequences. Performing\r\n"
"them as written would be nice, but we'll still pay you\r\n"
"either way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Let's get this thing rolling, then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "We're all set!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "All right, Kiryu-chan. Give us a good show!"
msgstr ""

